(text "Expander outputs power up as inputs; 10 k pull-downs hold coils, stepper power and enables off until firmware drives them." (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid e768a74d-2864-4191-8f15-c4739bc51b03))
(text "Stepper enable polarity is set in firmware after bench check 3. Any stepper alarm drops all motors (firmware)." (at 20.32 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 7b55cb38-b37c-4db6-9f7a-44e324be89b7))
(text "E-stop contact 1 sits in series with the watchdog-gated coil supply (J pins 1-2); contact 2 reports status (pins 3-4)." (at 20.32 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c0a28d30-ede1-45d2-a45d-ee97a4c883bb))
(text "Heartbeat watchdog: 74HCT123 retriggered by GPIO46. Q stays high while pulses arrive (period < ~0.2 s); otherwise the coil supply drops." (at 20.32 31.75 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 6115d76d-9a54-43a2-9d59-f7537137e21c))
